        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass sorting site</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass sorting site
A production site with a sorting capacity of 100 kt per year and a total life span of 50 a is assumed.;
UUID: e84ce84d-7de8-3b39-bf3f-ac9fddfa095b
This module includes the land-use, the material and construction efforts of the machineries the buildings. Dismantling of the machineries and the buildings are accounted for as well.
Location: european sorting site, based on few information from different Swiss sorting sites
Technology: Assumptions based on few information about the technology in Switzerland in the mid 90"s
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e84ce84d-7de8-3b39-bf3f-ac9fddfa095b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
